    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“You do not wave your hands and hope. You know what symbols are for.”</em></p>\n<p><strong>Archetype (Bad Eden): The Magician (Scholar).</strong> Researcher, operator, and wielder of applied understanding. You turn knowledge into leverage and leverage into effect.</p>\n<h3>Archetype Effects</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Faction Edge.</strong> This Archetype is associated with <strong>+1 Intrigue</strong> in faction calculus.</li>\n  <li><strong>Tier Engine.</strong> See this Archetype’s Tier feats (Tier 1–4) for the full tactical and strategic expression of scholarship, arcane literacy, research throughput, and recovered knowledge.</li>\n</ul>",
